[I] Localization support for DateTime.pm

[T] DateTime::Locale provides the localization data for DateTime, such as
[T] month and day names and date and time formats for hundreds of locales,
[T] generated from the Unicode CLDR.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/DateTime-Locale

